WEBVTT

00:01.470 --> 00:06.980
Mom gave me these coupons, but you need three in order to take part in the drawing.

00:09.610 --> 00:12.110
All right! You got the 4th place prize!

00:12.650 --> 00:16.490
That's too bad, but here are two packets of tissues.

00:14.360 --> 00:16.490
I think I have one right here.

00:16.490 --> 00:18.620
Nice, Aoi.

00:18.620 --> 00:20.200
Here!

00:20.200 --> 00:21.370
I'll leave it to you.

00:22.490 --> 00:23.290
But...

00:23.290 --> 00:24.500
It's fine.

00:24.500 --> 00:27.210
If you win anything, I'll take half of it.

00:28.330 --> 00:30.080
Okay.

00:33.090 --> 00:36.880
Subaru, do you have anything planned for the break after our tests?

00:36.880 --> 00:39.140
No, nothing really.

00:39.140 --> 00:42.100
Oh, next week is coming up.

00:42.100 --> 00:44.140
Tomoka and everyone else's field trip.

00:45.060 --> 00:48.350
It's during our break, too.

00:48.770 --> 00:53.150
I still have a lot I want to teach them.

00:53.610 --> 00:59.280
They absorb a lot at their age, so it's really worth it.

00:59.280 --> 01:04.330
As the coach of the fifth-year team, I've also come to realize that.

01:05.620 --> 01:09.370
Where are Tomoka-chan and the others going for their field trip?

01:09.710 --> 01:12.750
I think they're going to Kyoto for a two night, three day stay.

01:12.750 --> 01:14.920
I see. Kyoto, huh?

01:14.920 --> 01:17.510
Congratulations!

01:20.930 --> 01:25.730
You've won the grand prize! A ticket for two for an autumn vacation in Kyoto!

01:20.930 --> 01:23.810
Grand Prize<i></i>

01:20.930 --> 01:23.810
Autumn<i></i>

01:20.930 --> 01:23.810
Kyoto Vacation<i></i>

01:20.930 --> 01:23.810
For                      Two<i></i>

01:30.520 --> 01:33.650
Make them see that halation!

01:33.650 --> 01:37.070
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

01:37.070 --> 01:40.110
Spread out, new formation!

01:40.110 --> 01:43.620
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

01:43.620 --> 01:49.870
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

01:50.160 --> 01:54.790
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

01:54.790 --> 01:56.460
Leave it to me.

01:56.460 --> 02:03.010
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

02:03.010 --> 02:09.350
I remember each and every granted wish,

02:09.350 --> 02:15.230
including that day I cried in secret.

02:15.230 --> 02:18.690
We're not the only ones

02:18.690 --> 02:22.280
seeing these same dreams.

02:22.280 --> 02:25.910
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

02:25.910 --> 02:29.040
that appeared in front of me,

02:29.040 --> 02:30.580
let them fly!

02:30.870 --> 02:34.000
Make them see that halation!

02:34.000 --> 02:37.380
Run into that open space!

02:37.380 --> 02:44.010
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

02:44.010 --> 02:50.560
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

02:50.560 --> 02:56.810
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

02:59.030 --> 03:03.990
Aoi Wins?

03:00.780 --> 03:02.110
My clothes...

03:02.110 --> 03:03.780
My facial cream...

03:03.780 --> 03:05.070
My car sickness medicine...

03:05.070 --> 03:09.200
Nail clipper, sewing kit, stomach medicine, eye medicine, painkillers...

03:09.200 --> 03:11.830
Huh? Where are my band-aids?

03:11.830 --> 03:14.040
I have to start over again!

03:14.500 --> 03:18.250
Captain, that's the fifth time you've done that.

03:18.250 --> 03:22.550
We get it that you're excited for your trip with Sensei.

03:23.800 --> 03:26.800
N-No! I'm not!

03:27.300 --> 03:32.060
It's just a coincidence that I won, and I <i>did</i> agree to share the prize with him...

03:34.180 --> 03:37.230
Captain, congratulations!

03:37.230 --> 03:38.730
Wh-What?

03:38.730 --> 03:42.940
We've prepared a gift for you for your trip.

03:44.150 --> 03:47.610
A-A gift? It's not that big of a deal.

03:47.610 --> 03:49.910
Please accept it, Captain!

03:49.910 --> 03:51.830
It's a gift for all the care you've given us!

03:55.830 --> 03:59.000
Sono, Shouji... Thanks.

04:01.090 --> 04:02.800
What could it be?

04:08.180 --> 04:09.680
A-Are these...

04:09.680 --> 04:13.180
P-P-P-Panties?!

04:13.850 --> 04:15.430
Good.

04:16.310 --> 04:17.310
Hey, everyone!

04:17.310 --> 04:20.020
You ready for our field trip?

04:20.020 --> 04:21.270
Of course.

04:21.270 --> 04:23.070
Are <i>you</i> ready, Maho?

04:23.070 --> 04:24.650
You bet!

04:24.650 --> 04:26.690
I've checked my luggage five times already!

04:26.690 --> 04:28.450
Everything's just perfect!

04:28.450 --> 04:30.110
But this is really a surprise.

04:30.110 --> 04:34.540
I didn't know Hasegawa-san and Aoi-san were going to Kyoto on the same day.

04:34.540 --> 04:35.870
Oh!

04:35.870 --> 04:38.460
This must be fate!

04:38.460 --> 04:40.170
F-Fate?

04:40.170 --> 04:43.590
Subarun told us he'll come see us during our free time.

04:43.590 --> 04:45.170
Where are we going?

04:45.170 --> 04:46.340
Oh!

04:46.340 --> 04:49.470
I want to go anywhere with Onii-chan!

04:49.470 --> 04:51.680
I just can't wait!

04:51.680 --> 04:52.550
Hehe!

04:52.550 --> 04:55.140
Let's create lots of wonderful memories!

04:55.140 --> 04:57.430
Yeah!

05:04.650 --> 05:05.780
You lost!

05:11.490 --> 05:12.570
Here you go.

05:12.910 --> 05:14.330
Thank you.

05:14.330 --> 05:16.040
Ah, it's Mt. Fuji.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.200
It's so pretty!

05:17.200 --> 05:19.540
Y-Yeah.

05:19.540 --> 05:21.960
What's wrong? Your face is all red.

05:22.500 --> 05:24.000
Do you have a fever?

05:25.210 --> 05:28.090
I-I-It's nothing! I'm fine!

05:28.420 --> 05:31.550
Really? Okay then.

05:31.550 --> 05:34.600
But thank God I was with you.

05:35.600 --> 05:39.350
I probably would have failed without you.

05:39.350 --> 05:43.690
S-Subaru, you think about me that much...

05:44.900 --> 05:49.360
Of course. There's no one else but you, Aoi.

05:50.820 --> 05:55.370
Subaru, me too... I...

05:56.620 --> 05:59.790
Well normally, if I were to go on a trip with a girl,

05:59.790 --> 06:02.460
her parents would definitely be against it.

06:02.460 --> 06:05.630
But it's a good thing you're my childhood friend so they trust me.

06:05.630 --> 06:08.300
There's no one else but you!

06:08.300 --> 06:11.050
Y-Yeah, that's right.

06:11.670 --> 06:13.720
Where should we go in Kyoto?

06:13.720 --> 06:17.140
I should ask Tomoka and the others, too.

06:18.140 --> 06:21.020
It's nice to be with everyone, but I think we should go somewhere, with just the two of us...

06:21.930 --> 06:23.520
Did you say something?

06:23.520 --> 06:25.480
No, it's nothing.

06:25.480 --> 06:26.770
I see.

06:29.900 --> 06:34.110
Subaru-san! Aoi-san! Thank you both for waiting!

06:34.780 --> 06:36.320
Where should we go then?

06:36.320 --> 06:38.160
Kiyomizu Temple!

06:38.160 --> 06:40.290
We'll all jump off the stage!

06:40.290 --> 06:41.290
Oh!

06:41.290 --> 06:42.830
I've never done that before!

06:43.910 --> 06:45.580
We can't do anything dangerous.

06:46.290 --> 06:47.170
That's right.

06:49.670 --> 06:52.170
Wow! We're so high up!

06:52.170 --> 06:54.550
Th-That's dangerous, Maho-chan!

06:54.550 --> 06:57.430
Onii-chan! I'm gonna fly!

06:57.430 --> 06:58.970
Oh!

07:00.310 --> 07:01.770
No flying allowed.

07:01.770 --> 07:03.480
Oh!

07:03.810 --> 07:05.940
Subarun! Let's take a picture together!

07:17.240 --> 07:18.320
What is this place?

07:18.320 --> 07:21.700
You can borrow costumes and
screenplays from the Tale of Genji

07:21.700 --> 07:24.160
and take commemorative videos.

07:24.160 --> 07:27.000
That sounds awesome! Let's do it!

07:39.300 --> 07:42.770
S-Subaru— Genji-sama...

07:43.680 --> 07:44.820
Tomo—

07:46.460 --> 07:49.360
Murasaki no Ue, you look quite beautiful.

07:50.650 --> 07:52.980
N-No way...

07:55.360 --> 07:58.410
Subarun! No wait, Genji-don!

07:58.410 --> 08:00.370
I'm Yuugao!

08:01.080 --> 08:05.250
Hikari no Kimi, we finally meet.

08:06.410 --> 08:10.250
G-Good evening, Genji no Kimi.

08:10.790 --> 08:15.130
Onii-chan! I'm your wife!

08:15.670 --> 08:20.140
Wow! What wonderful little girls!

08:20.800 --> 08:24.810
Little girls?! What weird things are you saying, Subaru?!

08:24.810 --> 08:28.560
It's not my fault. It says so right here in the script.

08:28.560 --> 08:29.440
Huh?

08:30.020 --> 08:31.230
Oh?

08:34.230 --> 08:35.610
Wh-What?

08:35.610 --> 08:38.900
You look pretty good in those clothes.

08:38.900 --> 08:41.620
Wh-Wh-What are you saying?

08:42.280 --> 08:47.710
You, too... Those clothes make you look c-c-cool...

08:47.710 --> 08:51.210
You look cool, Subarun! They fit you really well!

08:51.210 --> 08:52.460
Oh, really?

08:52.460 --> 08:54.000
Yes, you really do!

08:54.000 --> 08:58.670
I'm sure the real Hikaru Genji was someone as regal as you.

08:58.670 --> 09:00.050
You look wonderful!

09:00.050 --> 09:00.930
Oh!

09:00.930 --> 09:02.520
Onii-chan is a hottie!

09:03.930 --> 09:05.470
You're so cool, Subarun!

09:05.470 --> 09:06.430
<i>That reminds me,</i>

09:06.430 --> 09:11.650
<i>Hikaru Genji raised girls that were around the age of ten to his preferences...</i>

09:11.650 --> 09:15.110
Is Subaru the same?!

09:12.910 --> 09:15.120
That's what she thinks.

09:18.190 --> 09:20.820
Wow! What's this?

09:21.360 --> 09:22.570
This is it!

09:22.570 --> 09:25.080
We <i>must</i> make a stop here.

09:26.950 --> 09:29.160
Youjiya?

09:30.710 --> 09:32.290
A toddler shop?!

09:32.460 --> 09:35.130
Subaru-san! I'm a toddler!

09:35.130 --> 09:36.710
Toddler! Toddler!

09:36.710 --> 09:38.050
I'm a toddler, too!

09:38.050 --> 09:39.590
I'm a toddler!

09:39.590 --> 09:42.090
Onii-chan! I'm a toddler!

09:43.720 --> 09:45.680
Which one should I choose?

09:46.350 --> 09:47.310
No!

09:47.310 --> 09:50.640
Subaru! No! No! This place is no good!

09:51.810 --> 09:55.270
Dad wanted me to send over some toothpicks to Hawaii.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.400
Something wrong with that?

10:08.950 --> 10:11.410
I didn't expect our hotels to be the same, too.

10:11.410 --> 10:12.910
What a coincidence.

10:12.910 --> 10:14.460
Yeah...

10:21.010 --> 10:22.880
Why're <i>you</i> here?!

10:22.880 --> 10:25.550
It's pure coincidence, nothing more.

10:25.550 --> 10:29.970
I wonder about that. Don't do anything weird.

10:29.970 --> 10:31.600
As if I would!

10:40.730 --> 10:45.280
The hotel's packed tonight, so they couldn't give us separate rooms.

10:45.280 --> 10:49.660
But I guess we're on a couple's trip, so one room is expected.

10:52.660 --> 10:53.410
Aoi.

10:53.410 --> 10:54.540
Y-Yes?!

10:54.790 --> 10:57.290
Go take a shower first.

10:59.880 --> 11:01.210
Huh?

11:01.210 --> 11:02.380
I'm looking forward to the bath!

11:02.380 --> 11:03.510
I wanna go right now!

11:03.510 --> 11:06.180
Takenaka, let's go explore the hotel!

11:06.180 --> 11:07.140
Yeah!

11:19.730 --> 11:21.780
Wait, everyone!

11:22.690 --> 11:24.150
Hey! You dropp—

11:29.490 --> 11:31.410
Hey, Takenaka, what's wrong?

11:31.410 --> 11:33.540
N-Nothing at all!

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Hakamada Hinata

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Date of birth

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Blood type

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Class

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
6th Year, Class C

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Height

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Bust size

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Second biggest in the club.

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
Words to Subaru

11:37.080 --> 11:40.040
I want to be with Onii-chan more!

11:40.670 --> 11:44.380
Sh-Sh-Shower?

11:44.380 --> 11:47.430
We've been walking around all day and got pretty sweaty, right?

11:50.800 --> 11:53.560
I'll go and buy some drinks.

12:11.490 --> 12:13.120
P-P-P-P...

12:13.120 --> 12:13.910
Pa-Pa—

12:37.680 --> 12:39.850
What am I supposed to do with these?

12:40.150 --> 12:42.650
<i>Just wear them and you'll be successful!</i>

12:42.650 --> 12:44.150
<i>I wish you luck!</i>

12:47.190 --> 12:49.070
No! No! No way!

12:49.070 --> 12:50.990
This is too embarrassing!

12:50.990 --> 12:51.780
I'm back!

12:51.780 --> 12:52.830
Welcome back!

13:03.670 --> 13:06.550
<i>What should I do now?</i>

13:09.470 --> 13:12.680
<i>What do I do with these panties?!</i>

13:13.300 --> 13:15.810
<i>I can't fall asleep here!</i>

13:27.110 --> 13:29.820
Huh? Did you not sleep well either?

13:29.820 --> 13:31.400
Yeah...

13:31.400 --> 13:33.360
I was worried about a bunch of things...

13:34.530 --> 13:35.320
"Either?"

13:36.130 --> 13:38.210
I see, I see. You too, Subaru.

13:38.550 --> 13:40.050
You were worried, too.

13:41.380 --> 13:42.840
I'll go get some tea.

13:42.840 --> 13:44.260
Oh, thanks.

13:46.850 --> 13:49.140
Return the panties you took tonight.

13:54.520 --> 13:55.770
Onii-chan!

13:55.770 --> 13:57.650
Good morning!

13:57.650 --> 13:59.990
You look like you've seen a ghost.

13:59.990 --> 14:02.780
No... Good morning, everyone!

14:03.110 --> 14:05.780
We thought you were gonna come play in our room yesterday!

14:05.780 --> 14:07.780
We kept waiting!

14:07.990 --> 14:10.000
Come tonight for sure, okay?

14:14.580 --> 14:17.420
Hey, what did you mean by that?

14:17.420 --> 14:18.840
Explain now.

14:18.840 --> 14:23.010
There's nothing to explain. You picked up Maho's panties last night.

14:23.010 --> 14:24.340
Return them tonight.

14:24.550 --> 14:26.430
How do you know about that?

14:26.430 --> 14:28.760
Wait, how do you know they're Maho's panties?!

14:28.760 --> 14:29.810
Subarun!

14:30.140 --> 14:32.390
I saw Maho drop them.

14:32.390 --> 14:34.350
Then why didn't you give them back to her right there?!

14:34.350 --> 14:35.810
I tried to!

14:35.810 --> 14:39.440
But my friend called me over and I had to hide them!

14:40.110 --> 14:41.440
I see.

14:41.440 --> 14:44.700
Then why did you make me pick up those panties?!

14:44.700 --> 14:46.450
You're one to talk!

14:46.450 --> 14:48.830
I've been through this before!

14:50.040 --> 14:52.410
You bastard!

14:52.410 --> 14:54.710
The moment you hid them inside your shirt

14:54.710 --> 14:57.420
is the moment you lost the right to lecture me!

14:58.000 --> 14:59.750
I'll help you out!

14:59.750 --> 15:02.260
We'll return Maho's panties tonight!

15:02.260 --> 15:04.090
I'm the one helping you!

15:04.090 --> 15:06.010
You picked those up originally!

15:18.060 --> 15:19.270
I'm going out for a bit.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.730
O-Okay.

15:27.360 --> 15:30.200
The girls are taking a bath right now.

15:30.200 --> 15:33.450
We'll sneak in their room right now and put the panties back.

15:38.540 --> 15:39.630
Miho-nee!

15:39.630 --> 15:40.960
Watano-sensei!

15:40.960 --> 15:42.790
What are you two doing?

15:42.790 --> 15:44.800
Are you gonna peek into the baths?

15:44.800 --> 15:45.920
Like we would!

15:45.920 --> 15:49.800
We're talking about basketball practice...

15:49.800 --> 15:50.970
R-Right?

15:52.060 --> 15:55.060
Basketball idiots, as usual.

15:55.060 --> 15:59.770
I guess it's better than doing dirty things to Aoi.

16:01.270 --> 16:05.070
Subaru-kun's a safe person like me.

16:05.070 --> 16:07.990
What part of you is safe?

16:08.910 --> 16:12.870
I brought a lot of things to play with you, Mihoshi-san.

16:12.870 --> 16:15.500
Let's enjoy ourselves nice and slowly later.

16:16.710 --> 16:18.120
Hey, Subaru.

16:18.120 --> 16:21.040
If I ever become a murderer,

16:21.040 --> 16:23.960
then please take care of my sister.

16:24.340 --> 16:26.420
Hang in there, Miho-nee.

16:26.720 --> 16:29.090
We wasted a lot of time back there!

16:31.050 --> 16:33.810
Hey! Do you even have them?!

16:33.810 --> 16:34.640
Yeah.

16:35.020 --> 16:36.390
Right here.

16:36.810 --> 16:37.980
You want to hold them?

16:37.980 --> 16:39.810
No, I'm fine.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.610
The panties!

16:44.610 --> 16:46.190
What are you doing, you idiot?!

16:49.190 --> 16:51.070
Wait for me.

16:51.070 --> 16:52.060
Hurry it up.

16:59.040 --> 17:01.330
Wh-What?!

17:02.420 --> 17:03.290
What's wrong?

17:08.510 --> 17:09.670
Tomoka...

17:09.670 --> 17:10.670
Hey!

17:11.090 --> 17:13.140
The girls' bath is over there!

17:13.140 --> 17:16.140
Wh-What did you say?!

17:17.850 --> 17:19.390
The water feels nice.

17:19.640 --> 17:22.810
Yeah, we walked a lot today.

17:22.810 --> 17:26.900
Yep! Hot springs, hot springs, outdoors!

17:29.950 --> 17:31.610
Hi-Hinata-chan!

17:31.610 --> 17:32.530
What?!

17:32.530 --> 17:35.080
Hey, don't peek! Don't you dare peek!

17:35.080 --> 17:36.870
I won't ever forgive you if you do!

17:37.790 --> 17:39.200
I know that.

17:40.250 --> 17:43.710
But where did my panties go?

17:43.710 --> 17:48.380
Maybe Natsuhi took them secretly like that other time?

17:48.550 --> 17:50.720
What nonsense are you saying?

17:50.720 --> 17:53.140
You must have dropped them somewhere, Maho.

18:01.100 --> 18:04.060
Our field trip ends tomorrow, right?

18:04.060 --> 18:05.360
It was so much fun!

18:05.560 --> 18:08.360
The trip has gone by in a flash.

18:08.570 --> 18:10.570
We still have tonight!

18:10.570 --> 18:13.450
Subarun should be coming to play with us!

18:13.450 --> 18:16.280
We'll create even more awesome memories!

18:16.450 --> 18:17.620
Oh!

18:17.620 --> 18:20.700
I want to create many more memories with Onii-chan!

18:21.750 --> 18:26.040
I wonder what Subaru-san is doing right now...

18:26.750 --> 18:29.460
Just a little bit more... Almost there...

18:35.050 --> 18:37.050
I somehow got them back.

18:37.050 --> 18:41.310
We wasted too much time, so they're back from their bath already.

18:41.310 --> 18:44.350
There's no other way. We'll go play in their room,

18:44.350 --> 18:45.940
find an opening, and return them!

18:45.940 --> 18:49.820
Will such a rash plan even work?

18:49.820 --> 18:51.440
Leave this to me.

18:52.400 --> 18:54.360
Subarun, welcome!

18:54.360 --> 18:56.280
Wait, why is Natsuhi here, too?

18:56.280 --> 18:58.990
It's not like I <i>want</i> to be here!

19:05.170 --> 19:06.830
Hey! What are you doing?

19:06.830 --> 19:09.040
We aren't here for a pillow fight!

19:09.420 --> 19:10.050
I know.

19:10.550 --> 19:12.090
I'll create an opening now.

19:12.090 --> 19:13.760
Takenaka, I'm leaving it to you.

19:17.720 --> 19:19.050
Subaru-san?

19:19.050 --> 19:21.520
You can't take it anymore?

19:21.520 --> 19:24.390
A duel is a duel. We won't go easy on you.

19:24.390 --> 19:26.940
Oh! Don't be shy!

19:26.940 --> 19:28.400
Hasegawa-san!

19:31.400 --> 19:32.530
That's...

19:35.700 --> 19:37.450
A floater!

19:38.620 --> 19:40.660
A no-look pass?!

19:49.500 --> 19:51.040
Go!

20:00.010 --> 20:02.310
Nice shot, Subaru-san!

20:02.310 --> 20:03.220
Oh!

20:03.220 --> 20:04.720
You were so cool!

20:04.720 --> 20:05.850
Yes!

20:05.850 --> 20:08.400
But this is a pillow fight.

20:09.480 --> 20:12.570
You really love basketball, Subarun, don't you?

20:12.570 --> 20:14.440
You got me there.

20:21.580 --> 20:22.200
I'm back!

20:23.120 --> 20:24.120
Ao... i?

20:35.380 --> 20:38.430
Hey, Captain. How was our gift?

20:38.430 --> 20:40.550
She won, right?

20:40.550 --> 20:42.890
Huh? You want to die?

20:44.560 --> 20:48.060
I'm sure he's got the wrong idea.

20:48.060 --> 20:52.810
He must think I usually wear something so perverted.

20:54.480 --> 20:56.940
I was so ready, too.

20:56.940 --> 21:02.070
I wanted to try it on, that's all...

21:02.490 --> 21:03.740
I want to die.

21:03.740 --> 21:05.040
Don't you die on me, Captain!

21:05.040 --> 21:07.200
But wait, isn't that a big success?

21:07.200 --> 21:10.620
Come back! Come back to us!

21:27.810 --> 21:29.980
Aoi, here you go.

21:30.310 --> 21:31.940
Wh-What's this?

21:31.940 --> 21:35.480
A gift for you for coaching the fifth-year team.

21:38.990 --> 21:40.740
Can I really have this?

21:40.740 --> 21:41.950
Yep.

21:41.950 --> 21:43.870
Thanks for this and that.

21:43.870 --> 21:45.490
Let's do our best together.

21:47.160 --> 21:49.620
Oh well, jeez.

21:55.590 --> 21:58.340
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

21:58.340 --> 21:59.880
Rolling! Rolling!

21:59.880 --> 22:02.800
Keep on bouncing!

22:01.090 --> 22:03.810
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

22:03.810 --> 22:06.220
Elementary schoolers are the best!

22:06.220 --> 22:06.600
Yay!

22:10.690 --> 22:15.690
Our bodies and our hearts are size SS,

22:16.190 --> 22:21.610
but our dreams can be size LL, can't they? Can't they?

22:21.610 --> 22:27.000
Adolescents have lots of troubles,

22:27.000 --> 22:32.580
but we'll overcome them together.

22:32.580 --> 22:38.010
I want to get even better!

22:33.380 --> 22:34.750
Even

22:34.750 --> 22:36.090
better!

22:38.010 --> 22:45.680
I want to see your face when I surprise you!

22:38.970 --> 22:39.630
Ooh!

22:40.300 --> 22:41.010
Wow!

22:45.890 --> 22:48.600
Just keep on spinning!

22:48.600 --> 22:52.520
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:52.520 --> 22:56.190
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:55.570 --> 22:56.880
I'll keep going!

22:56.820 --> 22:59.530
Just keep on spinning!

22:59.530 --> 23:03.490
The universe is one big basketball court!

23:03.490 --> 23:06.910
I want you to receive it.

23:06.200 --> 23:07.160
Ready, and!

23:06.910 --> 23:08.750
Pass! Pass! Pass!

23:09.160 --> 23:11.160
Please take it!

23:12.420 --> 23:15.170
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:15.170 --> 23:16.710
Rolling! Rolling!

23:16.710 --> 23:19.590
Keep on bouncing!

23:17.840 --> 23:20.590
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:20.590 --> 23:23.050
Elementary schoolers are the best!

23:23.050 --> 23:24.990
Yay!

23:25.250 --> 23:29.780
The other day, on our school trip, everyone wore ceremonial kimono.

23:29.780 --> 23:32.720
It was a little tight on my chest, but,

23:32.720 --> 23:36.710
Tomoka-chan and Maho-chan were used to it, so they were fine.

23:36.710 --> 23:40.040
How amazing! (Period.)

23:37.040 --> 23:40.040
Next episode
